    "Author's commit message: 'A mempool.dat entry with a time in the future is loaded as it is, so its transaction never expires, whatever -mempoolexpiry says.'",
    "Author description notes a functional test reproducing the failure when restarting a node with its clock behind an entry time passes with this fix."
